2. **Automated Tracking Script (Google Apps Script)**
```javascript
function updateCompetitorData() {
  var sheet = SpreadsheetApp.getActiveSheet();
  var competitors = ['url1', 'url2', 'url3'];

  competitors.forEach(function(url) {
    // Fetch pricing, traffic data
    var data = fetchCompetitorMetrics(url);
    sheet.appendRow(data);
  });
}
```

